Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0372: Guild Power tier titles, Grimsby High Rollers,
 Founder wording

- Five auto-generated GUILD_RANK_* achievements (guildPowerLevel vs
  GUILD_RANK_POWER_THRESHOLDS, now exported from guildRank.ts), granting
  the existing tier names verbatim as guild titles.
- Rising Guild is a starting default (createInitialState + migration
  67->68, SAVE_VERSION 68), not an achievement -- fires instantly rather
  than waiting on the first checkAll().
- New PEDDLER_HIGH_ROLLERS_TITLE achievement: peddlerGoldSpent >=
  1,000,000 -> 'High Rollers'.
- DashboardPanel.tsx: Guild Rank readout removed (rank/currentGuildRank
  cleaned up), title picker + 'next title at Y power' hint take its
  place.
- Founder title wording locked to 'The Founding Flame' in the status
  doc -- not yet wired into code, still blocked on a real founder-pack
  App ID.
- Verified: tsc --noEmit, vite build, electron-builder --linux dir
  package build, and a 7-check runtime script (via tsx) covering fresh-
  state defaults, migration (both the empty and non-empty cases),
  achievement threshold/title data, and id-collision safety.
